    "Bind the actual bounded-test staple influence to the full lattice neighbor matrix and complete a Gibbs comparison/functional inequality. The proved finite-matrix Neumann series is not by itself a correlation theorem. The natural 18-neighbor bound requires n>=3; its conservative small-beta criterion does not reach weak coupling.",
